      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T21:17:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d suggest that the new value be at the end of the list, right before `PDC_STATE_COUNT`. Making the value -1 will change variables of this type from unsigned to signed, which might violate some assumptions.\n\nThe most obvious problem I see is that values of this type are in some places used as array indices, which would be out-of-bounds with this value. Even with a positive value for this constant, I think you\u0027ll still want to update the accessed arrays to contain elements for this value.",
      "parentUuid": "767703d8_f787525f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "e690d390ed2064a6e80d9e5a47a73f9d5529a07b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
